  "cleanText" : "Quantum Computing Breakthroughs in 2026 Fault-Tolerant Logical Qubits Demonstrated Researchers have achieved a milestone in quantum error correction using surface codes and superconducting circuits. The new architecture achieves continuous quantum coherence across 10,000 physical qubits, demonstrating unprecedented gate fidelity and verifiable algorithmic speedups for combinatorial optimization and molecular simulation. This breakthrough paves the way for commercial fault-tolerant quantum computing in cybersecurity, distributed cryptography, and large-scale pharmaceutical drug discovery.",
  "rawHtml" : "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n <head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>Quantum Computing Breakthroughs in 2026 - Tech Times</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Detailed report on quantum entanglement processors and quantum speedups in distributed computing.\">\n  <meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"quantum, computing, processors, qubits, physics, algorithms\">\n  <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Dr. Alan Bennett\">\n </head>\n <body>\n  <header>\n   <nav>\n    <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a> | <a href=\"tech.html\">Tech</a>\n   </nav>\n  </header>\n  <h1>Quantum Computing Breakthroughs in 2026</h1>\n  <h2>Fault-Tolerant Logical Qubits Demonstrated</h2>\n  <p>Researchers have achieved a milestone in quantum error correction using surface codes and superconducting circuits. The new architecture achieves continuous quantum coherence across 10,000 physical qubits, demonstrating unprecedented gate fidelity and verifiable algorithmic speedups for combinatorial optimization and molecular simulation.</p>\n  <p>This breakthrough paves the way for commercial fault-tolerant quantum computing in cybersecurity, distributed cryptography, and large-scale pharmaceutical drug discovery.</p>\n  <footer>\n   <p>© 2026 Tech Times Publication</p>\n  </footer>\n </body>\n</html>",
